# Godot scenes (.tscn)

- **Do not** edit `*.tscn` files (or other Godot serialized scene/resource text) in the repo.
- If the UI or scene tree needs changes (nodes, exports, properties, resources), **describe the steps** for the user to apply in the **Godot Editor** (which nodes to add, which properties to set, export paths, etc.).
- It is fine to edit **C# scripts** (`.cs`) that attach to scenes; avoid changing serialized scene data on disk.
